cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "serverless-backup-sentinel"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency Python function that checks, from outside, that a recent
  backup exists in S3-compatible object storage, and alarms by email (Scaleway
  Transactional Email) or webhook when the newest backup is stale, missing,
  too small or unreadable. It sends a weekly proof-of-life message.
authors:
